## 二、VibeVoiceTextTokenizer - 文本分词器

### 核心功能

在 [`vibevoice/modular/modular_vibevoice_text_tokenizer.py`](file:///workspace/vibevoice/modular/modular_vibevoice_text_tokenizer.py) 中定义，基于 Qwen2 分词器扩展了语音相关的特殊 Token。

### 特殊 Token 定义

| Token 字符串 | 属性名称 | 用途 |
|-------------|---------|------|
| `&lt;|vision_start|&gt;` | `speech_start_id` | 标记语音输入/输出的开始 |
| `&lt;|vision_end|&gt;` | `speech_end_id` | 标记语音输入/输出的结束 |
| `&lt;|vision_pad|&gt;` | `speech_diffusion_id` | 占位符，每一个对应一帧扩散生成 |
| `&lt;|endoftext|&gt;` | `eos_id` | 序列结束标记 |

### 代码实现

```python
class VibeVoiceTextTokenizer(Qwen2Tokenizer):
    def __init__(self, vocab_file, merges_file, ...):
        super().__init__(...)
        self._add_vibevoice_special_tokens()
    
    def _add_vibevoice_special_tokens(self):
        # 添加特殊 Token
        special_tokens = {
            "additional_special_tokens": [
                "&lt;|vision_start|&gt;",
                "&lt;|vision_end|&gt;", 
                "&lt;|vision_pad|&gt;"
            ]
        }
        self.add_special_tokens(special_tokens)
        
        # 缓存 Token ID
        self._speech_start_id = self.convert_tokens_to_ids("&lt;|vision_start|&gt;")
        self._speech_end_id = self.convert_tokens_to_ids("&lt;|vision_end|&gt;")
        self._speech_diffusion_id = self.convert_tokens_to_ids("&lt;|vision_pad|&gt;")
        self._eos_id = self.convert_tokens_to_ids('&lt;|endoftext|&gt;')
```

### 快速版分词器

同时提供 `VibeVoiceTextTokenizerFast` 版本，基于 HuggingFace 快速分词器库：

```python
class VibeVoiceTextTokenizerFast(Qwen2TokenizerFast):
    @property
    def speech_diffusion_id(self) -&gt; int:
        return self._speech_diffusion_id
```

